Spec: Admin Frontend Layer
Purpose: Provide user interfaces for managing, configuring, and monitoring the MitM Data Aggregator.

Platform: Web / Desktop

Structure:
  ./mitm_fe_cpp/
  ./mitm_fe_web/

Owns:
  ./**

References:
  ./concept_admin_frontend.md

Must:
  Strictly separate logging concerns: system_logs for lifecycle/errors, job_audit_logs for processing metrics, admin_audit_logs for manual triggers/config changes.
  Connect exclusively to the core-layer via the provided REST API (JSON:API).
  Provide secure authentication flows (e.g. IAM session tokens) for all actions.
  Never persist plain text credentials, tokens, or PII to the local disk unencrypted.
